Package: rasterPoints
Type: Package
Title: plot scatter points using rasterImage and Rcpp
Version: 0.2
Date: 2021-03-19
Author: Sérgio Fortier
Maintainer: Sérgio Fortier <sergiofortier@yahoo.com.br>
Description: R point is slo for big number of points (millions). A faster way is convert the data and color information to raster (using Rcpp) and plot using rasterImage.
